emerge_relax -- descend vs select, ONE model and ONE scorer
offset-tied kernel, 21 offsets, planted K=3. 20 seeds x 200 epochs, lr=0.050.
common objective = accuracy - 0.50 * taps/21.  GA: pop 24, 60 gens, pflip 0.10.

