PASS/FAIL, fixed before running:
  FOUND THE TARGET if some lambda gives taps=3, contig=1, accuracy within noise of ideal.
  BEAT THE SEARCH  if a relax objective exceeds the GA's.
  If the tap-matched random column matches a relax row, that row's STRUCTURE is doing no
  work and only its SIZE is -- the same null that refuted emerge_tile.c.
